OL,3,GNEWSAFerry disruption after 'fleas'
OL,4,Adiscovered on board
OL,5,
OL,6,FFerry passengers were facing disruption
OL,7,Fon Sunday after a car ferry was taken
OL,8,Fout of service for fumigation.
OL,10,FWightlink said "insects, possibly
OL,11,Ffleas", were identified in an area of
OL,12,Fthe passenger lounge on board its St
OL,13,FClare ferry, requiring "specialist
OL,14,Ffumigation and enhanced cleaning".
OL,16,FMore than 10 sailings on the
OL,17,FPortsmouth-Fishbourne route have been
OL,18,Fcancelled as a result.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,336,330,200,160,0,100
