OL,3,GNEWSAFerry disruption after 'fleas'
OL,4,Adiscovered on board
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe ferry operator apologised for the
OL,7,Fdisruption and said the vessel would
OL,8,Freturn to service once the treatment
OL,9,Fprogramme was completed and required
OL,10,Fchecks had been carried out.
